    {
      "external_id": "5b9a1430367d5cab18668603",
      "poem_id": 75,
      "version_id": 75,
      "title": "忆江南词三首",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen0-1000.json",
      "content_hash": "d9c37d8fe390a3e1be5c48762b17efb80902b3aa0e5defa14836d69c66bc9351",
      "line_count": 5,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 江南好，风景旧曾谙。日出江花红胜火，春来江水绿如蓝。能不忆江南？\n2 | \n3 | 江南忆，最忆是杭州。山寺月中寻桂子，郡亭枕上看潮头。何日更重游！\n4 | \n5 | 江南忆，其次忆吴宫。吴酒一杯春竹叶，吴娃双舞醉芙蓉。早晚复相逢！",
      "stratum": "tang-poem",
      "annotation_status": "pending",
      "manual_labels": {
