      "title": "山居秋暝",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen0-1000.json",
      "content_hash": "19d3dc75e2fea2637e6f753173dbf2d960584a376a6691cb8ddd8a6009feff30",
      "line_count": 4,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 空山新雨后，天气晚来秋。\n2 | 明月松间照，清泉石上流。\n3 | 竹喧归浣女，莲动下渔舟。\n4 | 随意春芳歇，王孙自可留。",
