      "poem_id": 568,
      "version_id": 568,
      "title": "长歌行",
      "author": "王昌龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen1001-2000.json",
      "content_hash": "db81e0aa809df652c6255315abc5fc9963d29a78c49b94b0f4d88eb605be98d2",
      "line_count": 8,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 旷野饶悲风，飕飕黄蒿草。\n2 | 系马倚白杨，谁知我怀抱。 \n3 | 所是同袍者，相逢尽衰老。\n4 | 北登汉家陵，南望长安道。 \n5 | 下有枯树根，上有鼯鼠窠。\n6 | 高皇子孙尽，千载无人过。 \n7 | 宝玉频发掘，精灵其奈何。\n8 | 人生须达命，有酒且长歌。",
      "stratum": "tang-poem",
