      "poem_id": 753,
      "version_id": 753,
      "title": "海气",
      "author": "陆游",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen2001-3000.json",
      "content_hash": "dec7b0f0f11d95531f0aafa5defbff812a06bfd4dd3b73253fe59e5e5c7ce8a4",
      "line_count": 6,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 浴罢来水浒，适有渔舟横。\n2 | 浩然纵棹去，漫漫菰蒲声。\n3 | 海祲乃尔奇，万象空际生；骖驔牧龙马，夭矫腾蛟鲸，或如搴大旗，或如执长兵。\n4 | 我欲记其变，忽已天宇清。\n5 | 成坏须臾间，使我叹且惊。\n6 | 世事正如此，何者非强名？",
      "stratum": "song-work",
