      "poem_id": 909,
      "version_id": 909,
      "title": "禅人并化主写真求赞",
      "author": "释正觉",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen3001-4000.json",
      "content_hash": "fda5b0daa50a344080329e21eec672bf7fdd3aff4b8892b9f6be412efe7415f3",
      "line_count": 9,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 山林眉目，水月身心。\n2 | 雪何早而古岩棱，秋似先而寒潭深。\n3 | 机头绵绪，线尾金针。\n4 | 谁云道大兮自有知音。神静气清，\n5 | 心空眼明。诸尘中豁落，\n6 | 万像里峥嵘。去而随，\n7 | 来而迎。三世竖，\n8 | 十方横。风吹便倒须相信，\n9 | 恰恰谁曾与物争。",
      "stratum": "song-work",
