    {
      "external_id": "5b9a18d2367d5c0f40d230df",
      "poem_id": 857,
      "version_id": 857,
      "title": "玉漏迟 明湖白莲",
      "author": "林修竹",
      "dynasty": "当代",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen2001-3000.json",
      "content_hash": "39838b0063b3be0df4575f8b4e54d33d8f2c9ca976d1b7910442c4ba420488c4",
      "line_count": 7,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 荷香飘水上，明湖胜地，辄为神往。绿柳垂杨，花绰约波心荡。\n2 | \n3 | 一望婷婷十里，琼玉姿、高华堪赏。清溪漾。出水不滓，芳洁无两。\n4 | \n5 | 年年红袖青衫，尽湖上纳凉，花间荡桨。水榭亭台，风景令人怀想。\n6 | \n7 | 十顷白莲碧荷，送凉味、微风轻飏。静无浪。到处笙歌画舫。",
      "stratum": "other-dynasty",
