      "review_note": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "5b9a1430367d5cab18668600",
      "poem_id": 168,
      "version_id": 168,
      "title": "蝶恋花·春景",
      "author": "苏轼",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen0-1000.json",
      "content_hash": "d150cceb32c774adba0cd7d04c0bafbe6549f153abfad1937d86e94a0db6d584",
      "line_count": 2,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 花褪残红青杏小。燕子飞时，绿水人家绕。枝上柳绵吹又少。天涯何处无芳草！\n2 | 墙里秋千墙外道。墙外行人，墙里佳人笑。笑渐不闻声渐悄。多情却被无情恼。",
      "stratum": "long-text-or-ci",
