    {
      "external_id": "5b9a144e367d5cab186686cc",
      "poem_id": 272,
      "version_id": 272,
      "title": "望江南·超然台作",
      "author": "苏轼",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen0-1000.json",
      "content_hash": "28145bd461337514ca19c5d045ec886250a29879c308675b97d0dbe9b6c1951a",
      "line_count": 2,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 春未老，风细柳斜斜。试上超然台上看，半壕春水一城花。烟雨暗千家。\n2 | 寒食后，酒醒却咨嗟。休对故人思故国，且将新火试新茶。诗酒趁年华。",
      "stratum": "long-text-or-ci",
