    {
      "external_id": "5b9a1802367d5c0f40d22b71",
      "poem_id": 643,
      "version_id": 643,
      "title": "定风波·自春来",
      "author": "柳永",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen1001-2000.json",
      "content_hash": "17d8c2f2c8fca8586082a309e059c6dc51e536930f8bf14a76ccf65cdad696c8",
      "line_count": 2,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 自春来、惨绿愁红，芳心是事可可。日上花梢，莺穿柳带，犹压香衾卧。暖酥消、腻云亸，终日厌厌倦梳裹。无那。恨薄情一去，音书无个。\n2 | 早知恁么，悔当初、不把雕鞍锁。向鸡窗，只与蛮笺象管，拘束教吟课。镇相随、莫抛躲，针线闲拈伴伊坐。和我，免使年少，光阴虚过。",
      "stratum": "long-text-or-ci",
      "annotation_status": "pending",
      "manual_labels": {
