    {
      "external_id": "5b9a1476367d5cab186687d5",
      "poem_id": 385,
      "version_id": 385,
      "title": "浣溪沙·一向年光有限身",
      "author": "晏殊",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "source_name": "aopao/chinese-gushiwen",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aopao/chinese-gushiwen/c2345d0abf2404b8b3601e4afc2e8fd12f90d6c8/guwen/guwen0-1000.json",
      "content_hash": "595e57da92d1eb32c4133e07be42a0876e7eb805e465bc326d043b35323ef2f0",
      "line_count": 2,
      "line_numbered_content": "1 | 一向年光有限身，等闲离别易销魂，酒筵歌席莫辞频。\n2 | 满目山河空念远，落花风雨更伤春，不如怜取眼前人。",
